  "job_B23.2.3.2_20251003_114603": {
    "text": "\u00d0a ealdan l\u00e6ces gesetton on ledonbocum, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00e6lcum mon\u00f0e beo\u00f0 \u00e6fre twegen dagas, \u00fea syndon\n\u00de\u00e6s cunnede sume l\u00e6ce and let his horse blod on \u00fe\u00e6re tide, and hit l\u00e6g sona dead.\nNu syndon hit \u00feas dagas, swaswa hit her onseg\u00f0.\nSe forma d\u00e6g on Martio, \u00fe\u00e6t is on Hlydanmon\u00f0e and se feor\u00f0a d\u00e6g \u00e6r his ende.\nOn \u00feam o\u00f0rum mon\u00f0e, \u00fee we Aprelis hata\u00f0, se teo\u00f0a d\u00e6g is derigendlic and se \u00e6ndlyfte \u00e6r his ende.\nOn Maiusmon\u00f0e se \u00feridda d\u00e6g is derigendlic and se seofo\u00f0a \u00e6r his ende.\nOn Iuniusmon\u00f0e se X d\u00e6g and \u00e6r his ende se XV.\nOn Iuliusmon\u00f0e se XIII d\u00e6g and \u00e6r his ende se X.\nOn Agustusmon\u00f0e se I d\u00e6g and \u00e6r his ende se II.\nOn Septembermon\u00f0e se III d\u00e6g and \u00e6r his ende se X.\nOn Octobermon\u00f0e se III d\u00e6g and \u00e6r his ende se X.\nOn Nouembermon\u00f0e se V d\u00e6g and \u00e6r his ende se III.\nOn Decembermon\u00f0e se VII d\u00e6g and \u00e6r his ende se X.\nOn Ianuariusmon\u00f0e se I d\u00e6g and \u00e6r his ende se VII.\nOn Februariusmon\u00f0e se IIII d\u00e6g and \u00e6r his ende se \u00feridda.\nWe gesetton on foreweardan \u00feissere endebyrdnesse \u00feone mona\u00f0 Martius, \u00fee menn hata\u00f0 Hlyda, for\u00feam\nNu eft be \u00feam monan is mycclum to warnienne, \u00fe\u00e6t man on IIII nihta ealdne monan o\u00fe\u00fee on V nihta\nAc we gehyrdon seggon sumne \u00feisne mann, \u00fe\u00e6t nan mann ne leofode, \u00fee him blod lete on ealra\nNis \u00feis nan wiglung, ac wise menn hit afunden \u00feurh \u00feone halgan wisdom, swa heom god \u00e6lmihtig",
